        "name": "Dream-Laden Bough",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Hitting a champion or monster with a skill will deal additional max Health damage over time.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lillia's Abilities apply <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dream Dust</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(5% + (0.012% Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span> over 3 seconds. Lillia restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(39 + (15% Ability Power)) Health</span> over the duration against large jungle monsters, and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(30% Ability Power) Health</span> against champions.",
