        "bodyHtml": "Lillia winds up a huge strike, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/100/120/140/160 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Enemies in the center take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(240/300/360/420/480 + (105% Ability Power)) damage</span> instead.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Lillia does not dash over terrain with this ability.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 50% less damage to minions.</span>",
