        "summary": "Lillia causes all enemies with Dream Dust on them to become Drowsy before falling asleep. Those enemies will take extra damage on being forcibly woken up.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lillia causes all enemy champions with <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dream Dust</span> to become <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Drowsy</span> for 1.5 seconds. Afterward, they fall <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Asleep</span> for 2 seconds.<br /><br />When awakened by damage, they take an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Drowsy units are slowed over the duration, and fall Asleep afterwards.<br />Asleep units can't move or act until damaged by an enemy with non-periodic damage.</span>",
